# Title: Suspicious Microsoft Office Child Process - MacOS
# ID: 69483748-1525-4a6c-95ca-90dc8d431b68
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Sohan G (D4rkCiph3r)
# Date: 2023-01-31
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.persistence, attack.t1059.002, attack.t1137.002, attack.t1204.002
# Description: Detects suspicious child processes spawning from microsoft office suite applications such as word or excel. This could indicates malicious macro execution
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((ParentImage contains "Microsoft Word" OR ParentImage contains "Microsoft Excel" OR ParentImage contains "Microsoft PowerPoint" OR ParentImage contains "Microsoft OneNote") AND (Image="*/bash" OR Image="*/curl" OR Image="*/dash" OR Image="*/fish" OR Image="*/osacompile" OR Image="*/osascript" OR Image="*/sh" OR Image="*/zsh" OR Image="*/python" OR Image="*/python3" OR Image="*/wget"))
